Depth Anything V2
Upstream: https://github.com/DepthAnything/Depth-Anything-V2
Copyright notices in the individual source files are retained.
Code license: see LICENSE in this directory.

This source subset includes relative-depth and metric-depth network code and
their image/video inference scripts. Git history, example media, datasets,
weights, training entry points and training recipes are omitted.
The project adapter explicitly imports metric_depth/depth_anything_v2 for
metre-valued depth. Model-weight terms are separate and must be checked with
the upstream model distribution; no model weights are supplied here.
The two image2tensor helpers follow the model's current device rather than
selecting CUDA independently, so an explicit CPU selection is respected.

Published inference/export entry points require explicit output destinations
and external model-weight paths; no repository-local weight directory is assumed.
